                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "First volume was an excellent self-contained story about a fall from price and grace, while setting up a decent cast of characters. Everything from there felt downhill. The main heroine is barely present in Volume 03 despite having a huge impact on the story. So much of the writing is padded by finance jargon and if you're a fan of that, you might enjoy the game more. Overall, it just felt very poor starting from around half-way into Volume 02. Volume 02 skips over what feels like the climax, time skips, and then volume 03 is largely just jargon with a quick resolution. I cannot suggest this in good taste.",
